.field.report-auto-setting
  = form.label :auto_trip_report, class: "checkbox-field" do
    = form.check_box :auto_trip_report
    %span Automatically show the Google Photos album in Trip Reports after this trip ends
  %p.muted The album link will become public. Leave this off for member-only albums. Draft and deleted trips are never shown. You can hide a report separately without changing the trip.
